<title>GERMANY: BOJ's Matsushita - yen fall has been &quot;rather rapid&quot;.</title>
<headline>BOJ's Matsushita - yen fall has been &quot;rather rapid&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese central bank governor Yasuo Matsushita said on Saturday he thought the yen's recent fall had been &quot;rather rapid.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;I think the yen's fall from the beginning of this year has been rather rapid, and the pace of the import price increase has also been accelerating,&quot; he told reporters after the meeting of the G7 nations.</p>
<p>--Berlin Newsroom, +49 30 2039810</p>
</text>
